    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Suggerence Onboarding is a WordPress plugin designed to enhance user experience by providing an AI-driven onboarding process. It helps users discover features, plugins, and site-building packages through intuitive prompts and recommendations.</p>\n<p>The Plugin calls an external public API at https://api.ploogins.com/public/search and https://api.suggerence.com/v1/. The plugin sends the user query while searching for plugins to get recommended plugins using AI.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20it%20free%3F'>\nIs it free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the core features are free. Some advanced features may require a subscription in the future.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "An AI Onboarding Experience for WordPress Sites. Discover features, plugins and site building packages with prompts.",
    "description": "<p>Suggerence Onboarding is a WordPress plugin designed to enhance user experience by providing an AI-driven onboarding process. It helps users discover features, plugins, and site-building packages through intuitive prompts and recommendations.</p>\n<p>The Plugin calls an external public API at https://api.ploogins.com/public/search and https://api.suggerence.com/v1/. The plugin sends the user query while searching for plugins to get recommended plugins using AI.</p>\n",
